1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,940
Marcus had worked at the same company for 28 years.

2
00:00:03,279 --> 00:00:06,519
He knew every system, every process, every client.

3
00:00:06,919 --> 00:00:08,179
He thought that meant something.

4
00:00:08,439 --> 00:00:10,599
Until the day an algorithm reviewed his file

5
00:00:10,599 --> 00:00:13,500
and recommended his position eliminated.

6
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,400
No warning, no conversation,

7
00:00:15,859 --> 00:00:19,660
just an algorithm screen deciding his professional future.

8
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:23,199
He applied for 47 positions in 90 days.

9
00:00:23,199 --> 00:00:24,500
He got three interviews.

10
00:00:24,679 --> 00:00:27,399
None of them called back 28 years

11
00:00:27,399 --> 00:00:29,679
and he was starting over alone.

12
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:32,560
His company had 28 years warning.

13
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,140
They chose the algorithm instead.

14
00:00:35,679 --> 00:00:39,399
What if companies used AI to train their 50 plus employees

15
00:00:39,399 --> 00:00:41,719
instead of using it to replace them?

16
00:00:42,039 --> 00:00:43,920
We stopped waiting for that answer.

17
00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:46,479
Adults who have walked into our program

18
00:00:46,479 --> 00:00:50,179
thinking technology had passed them by were wrong.

19
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,000
You may be semi-retired.

20
00:00:52,299 --> 00:00:54,020
You may be planning your next chapter,

21
00:00:54,299 --> 00:00:57,060
but don't let an algorithm or anyone else

22
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:58,219
write your ending.

23
00:00:58,500 --> 00:00:59,899
You are not done yet.

24
00:01:00,299 --> 00:01:02,240
Learn more technologies.com,

25
00:01:03,419 --> 00:01:07,260
50plustechbridge.com, and digitalpioneer.ai.

